## Title: |cff0cd29fJaseTools|r
## Notes: XP colours and chat XP, Dungeon Journal view, alt inventory, mats and crates from alts, one-window professions with gold costs, craft and quest plans, Market advisor, BoE/quest/AH warnings, escort guard, Explore waypoints, skins. Each one can be switched on or off (/jq).
